herolte: power instrumentation and a CPU-rate measurement run (0433)

First step of docs/S7GE_ENERGIA_TERMICA_ARQUITECTURA_20261117.md: measure before optimizing. herobatms=<ms> sets the battery poll (30 s by default; 2-60 s); each poll logs "HEROLTE PWR: mA mV % battery-C cpu-MHz". herocycle=<s> (>=20) makes the power thread step the Mongoose cluster 2288 -> 1976 -> 2600 MHz every that many seconds while the screen is on and the SoC is not hot (hc_rate: the table of hg_cpu_up, voltage up first / down after), so one boot compares the rates. The charger dump slows to every 6th poll. Both off by default: nothing changes without the arguments.

